  (text "DIGIDASH BENCH BOARD  -  two card slots + one round screen on one CAN bus, for the bench (stands in for DigiDash2)" (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 3 3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "15b99d2a-82df-5849-82e7-82c3c6c4ef6f"))
  (text "Slot pinout: docs/hardware/accessory_ports.md (rev 2). Screen header: DigiDash2 J5 / J1 / J4 signals on a right-angle 2x20 at the board edge (the Waveshare ESP32-P4-WIFI6-Touch-LCD-4C plugs on, standing up). 12 V in (bench adapter, 17 V max)." (at 15 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ecde4ad1-8a5e-5c06-8c20-646a8170f4be"))
  (text "POWER: 12 V barrel jack -> SS34 (reverse polarity) -> VIN. VIN feeds the slots' constant 12 V and AUX 12 V, the IGN jumper (switched 12 V: fitted = key on), and a TPS563201 buck to 5 V / 3 A (TI's typical application, Table 7-2 values for 5 V). AP2112K-3.3 from 5 V." (at 15 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e634c3e4-c342-5798-a048-608fbcd3462f"))
