  (text "CARD SLOTS: slot 1 and slot 2 of DigiDash2 (J31 / J32), 2x15 sockets 25.4 mm apart, cards on edge with their parts side toward slot 1's open end. Per slot, as DigiDash2: 0.5 A PTC on 5 V and switched 12 V, 0.1 A on 3.3 V, 0.2 A on constant 12 V, a slot-ID resistor (1k slot 1, 3.3k slot 2: nodes 0x14 / 0x15). Shared: CAN, WAKE, LAMP, REV, the I2S rail, the audio bus, AUX 12 V (one 1.5 A PTC; AUX GND meets GND at NT1, audio GND at NT2)." (at 15 90 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "295ef6ce-72b5-5b75-bf41-45616e98af88"))
