  (text "WAKE: 100k pull-down (as DigiDash2); a card holding it high lights the WAKE LED (2N7002, so the LED loads nothing). LAMP / REV jumpers: fitted = dash lights on / in reverse. Each drives the slots' level (3.3 V through 1k) and, through a 2N7002, pulls the screen's pin low (GPIO24 illumination: low = dim; GPIO25 reverse trigger: low = reverse)." (at 15 185 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a609ff98-dd66-5716-a2ab-43f3273b9d34"))
