  (text "SCREEN: right-angle 2x20 at the board edge; the screen (Waveshare ESP32-P4-WIFI6-Touch-LCD-4C) plugs on and stands up, facing away. Its pin numbers (Raspberry Pi order, on its silkscreen) meet this header's pads reversed: pad p = screen pin 40 - p (odd) / 42 - p (even).\nScreen pins used (DigiDash2 J5 / J1 / J4 signals): 2 / 4 5 V; 6 9 14 20 25 30 34 39 GND; 17 its 3V3 (role strap only); 18 GPIO4 role strap; 16 GPIO5 sensor serial in; 19 GPIO3 TX / 21 GPIO2 RX (serial port, firmware GPS_UART_TX / _RX); 24 GPIO36 CAN RX; 32 GPIO34 CAN TX; 27 GPIO24 illumination; 28 GPIO25 reverse; 33 GPIO48 / 37 GPIO47 cluster I2C. Video pins: not used." (at 15 275 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8390248e-14e3-53f2-98e4-ab0fa9381047"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Connector_Generic:Conn_02x20_Odd_Even") (at 250 320 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "c9083ec8-332a-57c2-b84b-42ecb343fee9")
